;control for the drop-down. Precondition: the designer is already&#10;logged in (UC13), so this use case doesn't check the designer again -&#10;no InteriorDesignerLoginController." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="676" y="576" width="528" height="119" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1353" y="182" width="574" height="338" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1353" y="182" width="574" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="«entity»&#10;IDP" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=19;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1367" y="190" width="546" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="-idpId: int&#10;-designerId: int (owner)&#10;-categoryId: int&#10;-title: str&#10;-description: str&#10;-location: str&#10;-projectType: str (Current / Past)&#10;-status: str&#10;-createdDate: str" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1366" y="262" width="546" height="202" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=0;dashed=0;strokeColor=#334155;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1353" y="472" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1927" y="472" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="+addCurrentIDP(idp): bool" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1366" y="482" width="546" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColo